Additional source and artwork attributions\par
==========================================\par
\par
Inline SVG line icons\par
---------------------\par
Some inline line-icon geometry corresponds to Lucide / Feather, including the\par
chevron-down path and parts of the reset-order refresh icon. Geometry has local\par
size, stroke and path adaptations; the exact originally copied revision is not\par
recoverable from the project history. Lucide 0.468.0 and Feather 4.29.2 are\par
reference snapshots for the reproduced license texts, not asserted source\par
versions for every glyph. Generic plus, cross, check and window-control shapes\par
do not establish copying from a particular icon library. No icon package is\par
added to the dependency lockfiles.\par
\par
https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide/tree/0.468.0\par
https://github.com/feathericons/feather/tree/v4.29.2\par
\par
