Tauri starter code and default artwork\par
-------------------------------------\par
The application started from Tauri/Svelte scaffolding. The Tauri MIT option is\par
retained below for source scaffolding and adapted template code; Svelte tooling\par
and runtime terms are in the dependency inventory. This software copyright\par
license does not grant trademark rights. The six application icon/favicon\par
files and the tray icon previously depicted the Tauri mark. They have been\par
replaced by the project owner's selected Calendar TODO artwork. The Tauri\par
software attribution remains; it is not a grant of trademark rights.\par
https://tauri.app/about/trademark/\par
\par
